'''Mos Espa Way''' was the main street in the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories]] [[planet]] of [[Tatooine]]. It was lined with [[cantina]]s and [[Restaurant|stalls]] intended for tourists. Its side roads led into the entertainment district, and it was overlooked by the shopping district.<ref name="Altaya" />

